+
+## Task ids
+
+Every task has an `id`, a unique string that stays the same when the task is renamed. `list.get(id)` returns
+the task with that id. `find`, `complete`, `reopen`, `rename`, `tag`, `untag` and `remove` accept either a
+title or an id; an id wins if it is also some task's title.
